<title>USA: American Greetings stands by EPS range.</title>
<headline>American Greetings stands by EPS range.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Greetings Corp said Thursday it continues to believe that earnings for the full year will be in the range of $2.20 to $2.30 per share.</p>
<p>In fiscal year 1996 the company reported earnings of $1.54 per share, or $2.01 per share before a non-recurring impairment loss.</p>
</text>
